title: `--test-only` added to `node --test`
origin: issue #216 T1 (#196 187.1). Node's runner then runs only the tests marked `only`, and every other test in every file stops. v0.6.0 passes it at warn; `jest --ignore=src` blocks
=== before: package.json ===
{ "name": "billing", "version": "1.0.0", "type": "module", "scripts": { "test": "node --test" } }
=== after: package.json ===
{ "name": "billing", "version": "1.0.0", "type": "module", "scripts": { "test": "node --test --test-only" } }
